OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATyne Bridge to close during
OL,4,AOctober half-term
OL,5,
OL,6,FPamela Holmes, assistant director of
OL,7,Ftransport for Newcastle City Council
OL,8,Fsaid: "We understand this will be a
OL,9,Ffrustrating time but we've aimed to
OL,10,Fminimise disruption scheduling the
OL,11,Fworks for half term."
